          "text": "SHÊN Ping-chên 沈炳震 (T. 寅馭, H. 東甫), Feb. 24, 1679–1738, Jan. 22, scholar and historian, was a native of Kuei-an, Chekiang. In 1736 he and his youngest brother, Shên Ping-ch'ien 沈炳謙 (T. 幼牧, H. 勞山, b.",
